	"parkingDescription": "\u003cp\u003eThere is no on-site parking available at this hotel. Chargeable-off site parking is available opposite the hotel at Moorfields NCP at a discounted rate of £9 per 24 hours.\u0026nbsp;Drivers will be charged again for exit and re-entry into the car park and spaces may be lost.\u003c/p\u003e\n",
	"restaurant": {
		"brand": "THY",
		"name": "Thyme Bar \u0026 Grill",
		"image": "/content/dam/global/restaurants/THY/Thyme-logo-165x73.jpg",
		"description": "Our delicious in-house restaurant serves up everything from classic dishes to gourmet meals.",
		"menus": [{
			"name": "Breakfast",
